<p class="hint" data-l10n="" data-en="Thicker lines mean larger absolute weights; blue is positive (excites), red is negative (inhibits)." data-bz="1">线条越粗表示权重绝对值越大；蓝色是正权重（促进），红色是负权重（抑制）。</p>
