<p class="hint" data-l10n="" data-en="Observe: in the first few episodes it bumps around, the cells near the goal turn green first, and then the “good news” gradually spreads back towards the start; with enough training the step count drops close to the shortest path. With ε at 0 it may get stuck on a sub-optimal route." data-bz="1">观察：前几回合它乱撞，终点附近的格子先变绿，然后“好消息”逐渐往起点方向传播；训练够了之后步数会降到接近最短路径。ε 设为 0 时可能卡在一条次优路线上。</p>
